    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n37583" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">prae-fervĭdus</span></b> , a, um,
			adj., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>very hot</i>, <i>burning hot</i>, <i>torrid</i> (in prose not anteAug.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<b>Lit.</b>: fulgor, Att. ap.
				<i><span class="en">Serv. ad Verg. A. 1, 42</span></i> (Trag.
			Rel. p. 188 Rib.): 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">regio,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Col.
					3, 1, 3</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">balneum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Tac.
					A. 14, 64</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b>Trop.</b>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ira,</span>”
				<i>glowing</i>, <i>burning</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Liv.
					9, 18, 5</span></i>
			.</div>
